{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_0136oy9iqrht9mnfDC1nRbRF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All done. Final state of the run:\n\n**All 13 checklist items complete** — E1–E3 shared engine changes plus all ten SOS cards, one commit per item, with the full suite green: **1,247 passed** (1,145 engine regression tests with zero regressions, FDN reference tests, and 51 new SOS card tests). All ten card classes import cleanly, construct bare, and match their spec names.\n\nWhat was built:\n\n- **Shared seams (E1–E3):** `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` now fires from `cast_spell` *and* `cast_spell_free` (a free cast is still a cast per rule 601; copies still don't fire it); `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` fires from the `advance_phase` chokepoint after mana pools empty; `get_cost_reduction` aggregates `spell_cost_reduction` hooks from the caster's battlefield for instants/sorceries.\n- **sos_4** Converge draw/damage/lifegain off `colors_spent`. **sos_245** affinity for creatures, self + granted via E3.\n- **sos_1** graveyard cost reduction, attack-trigger free cast with one-shot exile-instead replacement — this required firing the previously-dead `AttacksTriggeredEvent` from `declare_attackers_step` and letting `move_to_zone` consult replacements on stack→graveyard moves (new `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent`).\n- **sos_226** Casualty 1 as a single `choose_card` prompt + `copy_spell`. **sos_57** Refute-style counter plus delayed one-shot mana at your next precombat main, backed by a new `card.mana_spent` record of the amount actually paid.\n- **sos_257** two mana abilities (the second producing instant/sorcery-restricted mana, honored at payment time via a small `ManaPool` extension threaded through `cast_spell`) and in-place {5} animation to a 2/4 Wizard with a per-spell pump that expires at cleanup and de-animates on leaving the battlefield.\n- **sos_120** exile-until-MV≥4 with optional free casts, and Paradigm: the original waits in exile while a recurring first-main-phase trigger casts real copies that cease to exist after resolving.\n- **sos_13** rule-722-accurate Prepared: becoming prepared creates a castable Swords copy in exile; casting it unprepares; the copy vanishes if Emeritus leaves. ETB lives in `on_resolve` (the engine fires ETB events before registering the entering card's own triggers — noted in TODO.md).\n- **sos_201** miracle {2} gated on a now-correct per-turn draw counter (added the missing reset at turn wrap) plus the opponent-upkeep loot. **sos_97** all four loyalty abilities, with a seedable `game.rng` for coin flips and skip-turn consumption in the turn-rotation logic.\n\nEvery deviation from the plan (e.g. paid-cast semantics for the prepared copy, \"next main phase\" ≈ next precombat main) is logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md` with the reasoning, and deliberate limitations are commented at the relevant code sites."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":802,"cache_read_input_tokens":316800,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":802},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f9ba450d-f060-432e-b173-842056ff72e4","uuid":"10bfd991-d632-4881-8151-6e565fa33f20","request_id":"req_011CbuLFqbGxQqUysYoLTeGb"}
